# Outcaster Trailblazer: "When this creature enters, add one mana of any color." It isn't a mana ability (the ruling): it goes on the
# stack as a triggered ability and the color is chosen as it resolves (CR 106.1b, 605.1b). Bot1 casts it with three Moxen and then
# chooses blue: the pool holds {U}, which no land or Mox of Bot1's makes here.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Outcaster Trailblazer
Plains x3
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Outcaster Trailblazer.Cast
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Colors(Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
[Bot1.Main2]

